## Import

Import a grant with `<share>/<grantee_type>/<username>`. The two-part `<share>/<username>` form imports a user grant:

{{codefile "shell" "examples/resources/motherduck_share_grant/import.sh"}}

After import, run `terraform plan` before applying to confirm the imported grant is still present in MotherDuck's share metadata.

## Audit the full audience

This resource owns one grant. To review direct grants and the whole-organization or public audience created by the share's `access` mode, read [motherduck_share_grants](../data-sources/share_grants.md).

